MODULE: OperatorRetiresUndecided
TARGET: NoPrematureRetirement
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: operator rebuild drops abandoned identity before every shard terminal has been captured
PERTURBS: RequestRebuild

--- FIND
    /\ requested' = TRUE /\ rebuilds' = rebuilds+1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<length, installed, value, read, ckpt, prepares, terminals, staged,
                   abandoned, cardinalityKnown, historyRetained, sourceDecisionCommitted,
--- REPLACE
    /\ requested' = TRUE /\ rebuilds' = rebuilds+1 /\ abandoned' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<length, installed, value, read, ckpt, prepares, terminals, staged,
                   cardinalityKnown, historyRetained, sourceDecisionCommitted,
--- END
